# Scapeshift sacrificing a merged land - Cubwarden mutated under Dryad Arbor, so the merged permanent is the land creature
# Dryad Arbor (CR 702.140c, 730.2) - searches for up to one land card: "that many" is the lands sacrificed, one, not the two
# cards it becomes as it leaves (CR 730.3c). Finding two is refused, and Tundra is found.
